{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06FG", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:773679818b77445381772501439b89f851dd10d227b4511e17df88f6034a02e5", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere is the first main result of this section.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0358e6aa0cd3d9025e44b80aa138741f7aac0e7eb086be1be14b007c857cb699", "unit_id": "tag:06FG:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "theorem", "parent_tag": "06FG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$s, t$", "MATH_0006": "$[U/R]$", "MATH_0007": "$S$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{theorem}\n\\label{theorem-flat-groupoid-gives-algebraic-stack}\n", "suffix": "\\end{theorem}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a41a1124fe8ab71360be3c13504847c94d522f0d780432a047949a045951bbdc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cf2705c23ed380137bf2022f439109509ceca72c8c9f2d4bd175e0812fcf956f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a groupoid in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0004>.\nAssume <MATH_0005> are flat and locally of finite presentation.\nThen the quotient stack <MATH_0006> is an algebraic stack over <MATH_0007>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1028b2bdf6fb86dd711e28c37bbbab238ac6730a8e6ade1dac455f75b0ff5a23", "unit_id": "tag:06FI:statement"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06FG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n(\\Sch/U)_{fppf} \\longrightarrow [U/R].\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{theorem-bootstrap}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-flat-quotient-flat-presentation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4bea8edbf351c89cc683afd37894b6e0a7740008e472375229f6af9aa7de68a7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c84aa24a8a2dbb47a09e71a7a6aacd1a905e388fec9065ec96aed8c823ed9d9d", "source_text": "We check the two conditions of\nTheorem <REF_0001>\nfor the morphism\n<MATH_0001>\nThe first is trivial (as <MATH_0002> is an algebraic space).\nThe second is\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5a4e71dbec98c2152d9059fa82c56afe877c73f4e9428725d8a90ab425e02d81", "unit_id": "tag:06FI:proof"}
